# Topic 3 — Exception Handling

Now we go **deep**. For a ~5-year Java backend interview, don't stop at `try-catch`; interviewers can drill into exception propagation, bytecode/runtime behavior, suppressed exceptions, custom exception design, and production error handling.

**Questions only — no answers.**

---

